:::text id=txt_pref at=top-left width=976 height=48 offsetX=152 offsetY=168 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=17
**Preferred Channel:** Face-to-face communication (does not matter if private or public).
:::

:::shape id=card_s1 at=top-left width=352 height=344 offsetX=80 offsetY=264 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_s1 at=top-left width=40 height=40 offsetX=104 offsetY=288 name=file-text size=32 color=#06B6D4
