:::text id=txt_s1 at=top-left width=304 height=240 offsetX=104 offsetY=328 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
**Step 1: Context**  
Provide the full Context of the feedback upfront to set baseline facts.
:::

:::shape id=card_s2 at=top-left width=352 height=344 offsetX=464 offsetY=264 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_s2 at=top-left width=40 height=40 offsetX=488 offsetY=288 name=target size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_s2 at=top-left width=304 height=240 offsetX=488 offsetY=328 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
**Step 2: Shared Understanding**  
Build Shared understanding of the problem and its impact on the business, product, or team.
:::

:::shape id=card_s3 at=top-left width=352 height=344 offsetX=848 offsetY=264 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_s3 at=top-left width=40 height=40 offsetX=872 offsetY=288 name=lightbulb size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_s3 at=top-left width=304 height=240 offsetX=872 offsetY=328 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
**Step 3: Proposed Solution**  
Offer an optional Proposed solution or improvement ideas to resolve it together.
:::